K; font-size: 18px;">日举行，</span><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt;">恭喜进入面试环节的小伙伴们！为助力各位考生顺利参加考试，现整理了面试注意事项，</span><span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px;">请各位考生及时关注，做到心中有数，从容应考！</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.8cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><br /></p><p style="text-align:justify;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;"><strong>一、面试时间</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.8cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; break-before: auto; break-after: auto;"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">3</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">月</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">14</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">日、</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">15</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">日</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.8cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">请取得面试资格的考生于 </span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">3</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">月</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">11-13</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-variant: normal;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">日登录</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">原</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">报名网站缴纳考试费用、打印面试通知书，并按照面试通知书上载明的要求参加面试。</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.8cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;"><br /></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;"><strong>二、面试考点</strong></span></p><p style="text-align:center;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">江苏省扬州技师学院新校区</span><span style="letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">（扬州市邗江区职中路</span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">31</span><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">号）</span></p><p style="text-align:center;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><br /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20263/6c0245105e3e406fa5659acc176cc208.png"></a></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a></a></p><p><br /></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20263/6c0245105e3e406fa5659acc176cc208.png"></a><a></a></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20263/26b2a32b568641b6ba0318a3daf076df.png"><img title="1.png" style="border:none;" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20263/26b2a32b568641b6ba0318a3daf076df.png" /></a><a></a></p><p style="text-align:center;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><br /></p><p style="text-align:center;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">校内考场位置如下图：</span></p><p style="text-align:center;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><br /></p><p style="text-align:center;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20263/a7fd8c2da65242c2bec8bfdf79e88e3d.jpeg"></a><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20263/292244b52fb64a7ba42379b7098f914e.jpeg"><img src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20263/292244b52fb64a7ba42379b7098f914e.jpeg" width="653" height="410" style="width: 653px; height: 410.929px;" /></a></p><p style="text-align:justify;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.74cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.8cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><br /></p><p style="text-align:justify;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;"><strong>三、温馨提示</strong></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-style: normal; ; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px;">请提前熟悉考场的位置和路线，合理安排赴考行程，规划好备用路线，注意出行安全，预足时间，提早到达，避免因迟到而造成遗憾。</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal;">根据面试管理相关要求，社会车辆禁止进入考点，考生也不能提前进入考点熟悉情况。考试当天，请接送考生的车辆在职中路上即停即走，并服从现场工作人员的指引，避免造成交通拥堵。</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.95cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-variant: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.3pt; backgro